WEBVTT

00:13:59.579 --> 00:14:02.162
the culture that is being
spread around the world.

00:14:02.579 --> 00:14:05.746
That is the power that all of us have in
a world where social media exists.

00:14:06.246 --> 00:14:08.787
Again, that is a sword that
cuts both ways as well.

00:14:09.037 --> 00:14:12.037
But it is something that
that power exists

00:14:12.037 --> 00:14:15.579
for all of us if we want to become
advocates on behalf of any ideas,

00:14:15.787 --> 00:14:19.662
you know, diversifying Hollywood
or diversifying Congress

00:14:19.662 --> 00:14:23.746
or making sure that people have enough
food to eat and a roof over their heads.

00:14:28.162 --> 00:14:30.996
We'll be right back with more from
Franklin Leonard after this break.